1
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:41,560
Who is it?

2
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,680
What brings you here?

3
00:01:46,159 --> 00:01:46,799
Come in.

4
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:47,959
No need to take off your shoes. I'll mop later.

5
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:49,519
Awu,

6
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:51,319
He kept insisting at home

7
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:52,879
that he wanted to see your new place.

8
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,760
Isn't that right, Awu?

9
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:55,799
No, that's not true.

10
00:01:56,519 --> 00:01:57,840
It was because I saw Grandpa at home

11
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,359
constantly talking about Ding Ning,

12
00:01:59,359 --> 00:02:00,239
so I dragged him here.

13
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:01,000
What's wrong?

14
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,079
Didn't you say

15
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:02,920
that with one person gone,

16
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,319
the house feels empty?

17
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:07,799
Well, I can't live at your place forever.

18
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,919
I only stayed because Awu didn't know you well.

19
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,159
But now, look at him.

20
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:12,319
He's so attached to you.

21
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,240
So you don't need me to look after him there anymore.

22
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,680
Besides, Awu

23
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,719
will have to move back in with Zhao Yijie eventually.

24
00:02:17,719 --> 00:02:18,599
Right, Awu?

25
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:19,960
He can't live at your place forever.

26
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:20,680
Thank you.

27
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,960
Zhao Yijie is so busy.

28
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,400
How is he going to take care of him?

29
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,360
With school,

30
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,919
and tutoring after school.

31
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,599
What else are you missing here?

32
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,199
I'll bring it over from my place.

33
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:31,879
No need.

34
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,000
It's just a place to sleep.

35
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,280
Simple is fine.

36
00:02:34,479 --> 00:02:36,639
But you don't seem to have a wardrobe.

37
00:02:37,199 --> 00:02:39,120
Your clothes will get dusty hanging out like that.

38
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:41,639
It's fine.

39
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:43,439
I never use closed wardrobes.

40
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,800
Why not?

41
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:50,159
I'm just not used to them.

42
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,840
Grandpa,

43
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:55,719
look, isn't that our house?

44
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,360
Yeah.

45
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,159
You can see our house from here.

46
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:01,199
I specifically found this spot

47
00:03:01,199 --> 00:03:03,319
so Ding Ning can see us too.

48
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,159
You should open the windows sometimes

49
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:12,560
to let some air in.

50
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:20,680
You're burning up.

51
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,639
Grandpa, do you want some water?

52
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,360
Awu.

53
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:26,919
Come here, Awu.

54
00:03:26,919 --> 00:03:27,639
Ding Ning.

55
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,520
Where's Grandpa?

56
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:30,000
He's burning up.

57
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,560
You're a smart boy, knowing to call me.

58
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,639
Lao Yu.

59
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:38,560
How are you feeling?

60
00:03:41,319 --> 00:03:42,120
You're burning up.

61
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,000
You were fine during the day.

62
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,919
Awu, go get me a basin.

63
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:57,560
Here, have you taken your temperature?

64
00:04:21,639 --> 00:04:22,279
Here.

65
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:27,199
How is his fever this high?

66
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:33,399
Here.

67
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,759
Awu, did Grandpa take his medicine?

68
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,240
He won't take it.

69
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:43,959
He won't?

70
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,879
Why won't he take his medicine?

71
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,879
Refusing to take his medicine. Honestly.

72
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:52,959
How are these expired?

73
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,319
How could...

74
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:57,199
Who is it?

75
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:03,839
Awu.

76
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:04,360
Ding Ning.

77
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,040
Your parents and Uncle Wang went on a trip.

78
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,360
You're here.

79
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,480
Awu said Lao Yu is sick.

80
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:16,439
What's the situation?

81
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,399
He has a fever. He's completely delirious.

82
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,360
I bought some medicine.

83
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,519
See if this helps.

84
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:23,759
That's great.

85
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,199
I was just about to order some.

86
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,480
All of his medicine is expired.

87
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,279
What's his temperature?

88
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,720
38.5 degrees.

89
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,160
Should we just take him to the hospital?

90
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,399
Before the fever fries his brain.

91
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,720
Let's have him take the medicine first.

92
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,720
If his fever doesn't break later,

93
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,600
we really have to take him to the hospital.

94
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:42,319
Well, Awu, let's go home.

95
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:44,360
Let's not disturb Grandpa Yu's rest.

96
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,600
Ding Ning.

97
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,360
Are you going home for Chinese New Year?

98
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:51,240
I don't know.

99
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,639
My parents went on a trip.

100
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,480
How about spending it at my place?

101
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,079
Well...

102
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:57,439
No, I mean,

103
00:05:57,839 --> 00:06:00,040
you two have been watching the kid for me lately.

104
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,240
It's been hard on you.

105
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,920
Look, Lao Yu even got sick from exhaustion.

106
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:05,319
How about we have New Year's Eve dinner together?

107
00:06:05,319 --> 00:06:06,319
Let me show my appreciation.

108
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,360
Awu.

109
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,040
Should we invite Grandpa Yu and Sister Ding Ning

110
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,959
to our place for Chinese New Year?

111
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:16,399
How does that sound?

112
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,000
Good!

113
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:18,920
Good.

114
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,519
Then I'll take him back first.

115
00:06:21,839 --> 00:06:22,879
What's going on here?

116
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,040
Is it not cold enough?

117
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,879
You take a look for him.

118
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:27,759
We'll head back first.

119
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:29,040
I'm afraid Awu might catch it.

120
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:31,399
Let's go. Pack your things, we're going home.

121
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:33,120
Going home!

122
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,680
Going home!

123
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,360
All right, you get some rest.

124
00:06:37,519 --> 00:06:39,519
It's good for Awu to stay at Zhao Yijie's for a couple days.

125
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,879
So you don't infect him.

126
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:42,360
There's no one to take care of him these two days anyway.

127
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:23,839
As for Ma Tingting's investigation team,

128
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,600
it's already been disbanded.

129
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,920
We have completely cut ties

130
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,720
with Fuxia Group now.

131
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,000
So, for now at least,

132
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,079
we are safe.

133
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:33,959
Good.

134
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:36,319
Good work, to you and Yijie.

135
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,600
Just doing our job, Mr. Bi.

136
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,360
Are you going abroad?

137
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:46,920
A friend at the embassy told me

138
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,839
you applied for a visa a couple of days ago.

139
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:51,680
Well, here's the thing.

140
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,759
As for Yu Songfan,

141
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:56,000
I think he's still of some use to us.

142
00:07:56,879 --> 00:07:58,199
The Sham Litigation Factory incident

143
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,720
hit him pretty hard.

144
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,360
So I want to humor him a bit,

145
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:04,160
and arrange a short trip abroad for him and Yang Awu.

146
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:07,839
Fair enough.

147
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:13,560
Yijie, Ruqing.

148
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,000
You need to understand,

149
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,959
people like us

150
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:17,879
can never live ordinary lives.

151
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,319
Understood.

152
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:20,959
Since we chose this path,

153
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,040
once we start,

154
00:08:22,079 --> 00:08:23,319
there's no turning back.

155
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,560
Yes.

156
00:08:26,759 --> 00:08:27,759
As for the Liang Zidong matter,

157
00:08:28,839 --> 00:08:29,800
handle it as you see fit.

158
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,360
Get lost! If you can't play, get the hell out!

159
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,159
Can't you do anything right?!

160
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,279
Mr. Bi, maybe we should leave you to it.

161
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,159
It's fine.

162
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,000
Stay seated.

163
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:39,960
Why don't you just die?!

164
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,159
Get lost! All of you, drop dead!

165
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:43,120
He's just a kid, you know.

166
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:44,840
Ever since he came back from abroad,

167
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:45,960
he's been like this.

168
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,879
He just hides in his room playing games all day.

169
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:49,799
He's become very distant from me, too.

170
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:56,639
Then about what I mentioned regarding Ding Ning...

171
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,600
Do you really know Ding Ning?

172
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:02,919
To tell you the truth,

173
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,159
even with my own son,

174
00:09:05,159 --> 00:09:06,559
I don't truly know him.

175
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:09,519
Are you certain you truly know Ding Ning?

176
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:10,840
Lost again! Lost again!

177
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,679
Do you even know how to play?!

178
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:15,960
Let's forget about Ding Ning.

179
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,039
At a time like this,

180
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,639
we can't afford a single mistake.

181
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:22,639
Okay.

182
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,559
We'll follow your lead.

183
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:26,519
We'll do as you say.

184
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,720
I'll kill you!

185
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:30,039
I'm going to kill you!

186
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,519
You just wait!

187
00:09:44,679 --> 00:09:45,399
Go down, down!

188
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,200
Wait a second.

189
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,519
Don't move forward.

190
00:09:49,519 --> 00:09:50,240
You go first.

191
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,399
Go down!

192
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,120
I'll kick!

193
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,360
Hurry!

194
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,600
Next level.

195
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,440
Ding Ning, you're finally here.

196
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,440
Come on! What is it? Come on!

197
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,120
Hurry up and make them.

198
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,600
I really don't know how.

199
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,759
Awu.

200
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,519
Hello, Grandpa.

201
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:08,679
Hello.

202
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,480
It's starting! Start!

203
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,240
Quick, quick! Hurry!

204
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,559
What's up? Playing a game?

205
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:17,679
How long have you been playing?

206
00:10:17,679 --> 00:10:19,840
Do you want to take a break, Awu?

207
00:10:19,919 --> 00:10:20,799
It's Chinese New Year today.

208
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:23,399
Let Awu play a bit longer, seriously.

209
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:24,240
All right, all right.

210
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,159
Hurry, let's eat.

211
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,440
We'll leave after eating, Awu.

212
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,360
For our New Year's Eve dinner,

213
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:28,639
I prepared dumplings.

214
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:29,919
But neither of us knows how to make them.

215
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,320
We have to count on you.

216
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:34,879
You invite us over for a meal,

217
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:37,039
but ask me to help make dumplings?

218
00:10:37,039 --> 00:10:39,000
Is that the point of this New Year's Eve dinner?

219
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:41,000
How does that make any sense?

220
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,960
The two of us don't know how.

221
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:44,120
What's wrong with helping make dumplings?

222
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:45,799
Who only eats dumplings for Chinese New Year?

223
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:47,159
Well, who doesn't eat dumplings for Chinese New Year?

224
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,480
What's wrong with helping out?

225
00:10:48,879 --> 00:10:50,360
So are we having our New Year's Eve dinner or not?

226
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:50,840
How about this?

227
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,639
Let's go out for a nice meal, okay?

228
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:54,600
What would we even eat out during Chinese New Year?

229
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,080
I kindly prepared all this stuff,

230
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:56,879
waiting for you guys.

231
00:10:56,879 --> 00:10:58,559
Don't you want to celebrate Chinese New Year together at home?

232
00:10:58,559 --> 00:11:00,440
A reunion dinner means eating out.

233
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,519
I want to eat dumplings.

234
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:03,840
Did you hear that?

235
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,399
Awu.

236
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:08,320
Today is Chinese New Year.

237
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,639
Didn't you prepare a gift for Grandpa?

238
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:11,840
Where's the gift?

239
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,559
Happy New Year, Grandpa!

240
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,840
What's the harmonica for?

241
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,960
Is it a gift for me?

242
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,200
I don't even know how to play it.

243
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:31,919
When Grandpa misses Awu,

244
00:11:31,919 --> 00:11:34,360
just play it twice, and Awu will appear.

245
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:36,879
Okay!

246
00:11:41,159 --> 00:11:42,120
So many words.

247
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:44,600
Did you write all this yourself,

248
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,720
or did someone help you?

249
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,080
Did you draw this?

250
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,679
Who's this? Who are these two?

251
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,559
This is me, and this is you.

252
00:11:59,000 --> 00:11:59,639
All right.

253
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,960
You haven't fully recovered yet.

254
00:12:01,279 --> 00:12:01,759
Come here.

255
00:12:01,919 --> 00:12:03,559
Let Grandpa go make dumplings now.

256
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:05,480
Are you hungry?

257
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,960
Let Grandpa go quickly, hurry.

258
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,000
I'll do it.

259
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:09,720
Go ahead.

260
00:12:12,799 --> 00:12:15,440
Ding Ning, get me a bowl of water.

261
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:18,120
Just plain water is fine.

262
00:12:18,559 --> 00:12:19,200
What's wrong?

263
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,559
You wrapped them like a dessert platter.

264
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,879
Finding faults the moment you recover?

265
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:26,960
I'm not finding fault.

266
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,840
You're the one with the problem.

267
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,480
Making these is very simple.

268
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:32,360
Put the filling in the wrapper and pinch.

269
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,519
After you pinch them, you boil them.

270
00:12:33,519 --> 00:12:34,279
After you boil them, you eat them.

271
00:12:34,279 --> 00:12:34,960
After you eat them, you leave.

272
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,360
It's really that simple.

273
00:12:36,679 --> 00:12:37,759
Just ignore him.

274
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:39,200
Here.

275
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:46,159
You're so bad at this.

276
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,720
Come out and fight if you have the guts.

277
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,840
Route 33, Huarun Road East Station.

278
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,000
Whoever doesn't show up is a coward.

279
00:13:07,759 --> 00:13:08,759
Deal.

280
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:19,600
Come on!

281
00:13:19,919 --> 00:13:21,200
Here, the dumplings are ready.

282
00:13:21,919 --> 00:13:22,559
Awu.

283
00:13:22,919 --> 00:13:24,159
Come wash your hands and eat.

284
00:13:24,759 --> 00:13:25,399
Coming!

285
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,519
You've been playing that game for so long.

286
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,919
Zhao Yijie, do you have vinegar?

287
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:31,840
Vinegar?

288
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,399
Yeah, vinegar.

289
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,600
You invited us to your place for dumplings,

290
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,799
