292
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,320
I'll go buy some now, okay?

293
00:13:40,799 --> 00:13:41,720
I'll go with you.

294
00:13:41,919 --> 00:13:42,759
How about I go?

295
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:44,480
No need. The two of us will go.

296
00:14:00,799 --> 00:14:01,519
Have a seat.

297
00:14:04,799 --> 00:14:05,639
Smells good, doesn't it?

298
00:14:06,879 --> 00:14:07,639
Wait a second.

299
00:14:07,639 --> 00:14:08,879
Let's wait for them to get back before we eat, okay?

300
00:14:08,879 --> 00:14:09,440
Okay.

301
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:47,600
Coward

302
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,399
Tianxingzhe.

303
00:15:08,559 --> 00:15:10,480
I'm talking to you. Are you Tianxingzhe?

304
00:15:10,799 --> 00:15:12,120
Are you here to fight Glittering Galaxy?

305
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:12,879
No.

306
00:15:16,799 --> 00:15:17,639
You're crazy.

307
00:15:23,799 --> 00:15:24,679
Apologize to me.

308
00:15:26,399 --> 00:15:27,200
Why?

309
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,080
I'll give you one more chance.

310
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:29,919
Apologize to me.

311
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,159
I'm asking you again.

312
00:15:31,159 --> 00:15:32,240
Why should I apologize to you?

313
00:15:32,519 --> 00:15:33,360
You just insulted me.

314
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,080
Apologize to me.

315
00:15:39,759 --> 00:15:42,399
You're crazy! You're crazy!

316
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:08,840
Brat

317
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:08,880
It's the New Year. Where did you go again?

318
00:17:09,119 --> 00:17:09,880
Come home right now.

319
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,440
Mom.

320
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,200
Put Dad on the phone.

321
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:20,000
Buying so much vinegar...

322
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:22,039
I think you're just jealous.

323
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:24,880
I really need to make this clear to you.

324
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,400
After this New Year's Eve dinner,

325
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:28,279
Awu is coming back to my place. Remember that.

326
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:29,640
Why should he?

327
00:17:30,839 --> 00:17:31,839
Let's get one thing straight.

328
00:17:31,839 --> 00:17:33,000
He is my child.

329
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,319
You get it straight.

330
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,680
You only adopted him.

331
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,880
I'm his biological Grandpa, you hear me?

332
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,160
I forgot.

333
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,799
So you finally acknowledge him?

334
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,640
Don't you want to explain things to Ding Ning first?

335
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,920
Why are you getting so stubborn lately?

336
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:57,839
Let's both take a step back.

337
00:17:57,839 --> 00:17:58,799
And make some changes.

338
00:17:58,799 --> 00:18:00,640
Aren't things pretty good right now?

339
00:18:01,079 --> 00:18:02,279
Please don't forget,

340
00:18:02,759 --> 00:18:04,799
you can celebrate this New Year in peace

341
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:05,519
all because

342
00:18:05,519 --> 00:18:06,799
I saved you at the secret base last time.

343
00:18:06,799 --> 00:18:08,400
You saved me? You saved me?

344
00:18:08,559 --> 00:18:09,440
You were saving yourself!

345
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,279
Think about it.

346
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:12,599
If they really took me in,

347
00:18:12,599 --> 00:18:14,519
I would've spilled everything.

348
00:18:14,759 --> 00:18:16,279
Mutual destruction, you understand?

349
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,839
Mutual destruction.

350
00:18:18,759 --> 00:18:20,440
Stop trying to act tough.

351
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,279
You scared yourself sick.

352
00:18:22,279 --> 00:18:24,279
I was the one who bought you the medicine, right?

353
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:28,160
I know. You just don't believe me.

354
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,720
You don't believe I found my conscience

355
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,920
and that's why I saved you.

356
00:18:32,039 --> 00:18:33,000
In your heart,

357
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:33,960
I will always be that

358
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,799
bad guy who only uses you, right?

359
00:18:35,799 --> 00:18:36,680
Yes. Yes.

360
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,759
You are a bad guy.

361
00:18:37,759 --> 00:18:39,839
That's why I don't want Awu raised in your house.

362
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:41,039
Do you understand? Do you?

363
00:18:41,039 --> 00:18:42,759
You simply won't accept my kindness.

364
00:18:43,279 --> 00:18:44,119
Hold on a second.

365
00:18:48,279 --> 00:18:48,920
Hello.

366
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,440
What's this about?

367
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,559
Why... why the sudden call?

368
00:19:02,079 --> 00:19:03,680
Okay. I understand.

369
00:19:04,319 --> 00:19:05,440
I'll head over right now.

370
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:08,599
Something came up. I have to go.

371
00:19:08,759 --> 00:19:09,519
Don't run away.

372
00:19:09,519 --> 00:19:10,920
We aren't done talking about the kid.

373
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:12,559
Lao Yu.

374
00:19:12,559 --> 00:19:13,319
Lao Yu, look.

375
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:14,720
Whatever happened before,

376
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,519
is all in the past, okay?

377
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,680
Think whatever you want.

378
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,839
Starting today,

379
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:20,400
