380
00:19:20,559 --> 00:19:21,359
The kid...

381
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,039
You take the kid for now.

382
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:19,200
What took you guys so long?

383
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,039
An emergency.

384
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:23,160
What emergency could there be during Chinese New Year?

385
00:20:25,359 --> 00:20:27,000
Hello? Hello?

386
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:42,960
Awu.

387
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:46,200
Grandpa and the others might be back late.

388
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:48,759
How about I heat up the dumplings for you?

389
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:50,039
Let's eat first, okay?

390
00:20:50,039 --> 00:20:51,079
You must be hungry.

391
00:20:51,599 --> 00:20:53,240
Where did Grandpa and the others go?

392
00:21:15,279 --> 00:21:15,920
Little Lu.

393
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:20,680
Little Lu.

394
00:21:24,599 --> 00:21:26,079
Uncle, Happy New Year.

395
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:28,160
I bought some New Year goods.

396
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:30,400
I'll put them here for you.

397
00:21:48,799 --> 00:21:50,039
Where did he run off to?

398
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:51,920
Little Lu

399
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,200
After this red light,

400
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,640
there's no turning back.

401
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:48,839
If you want to back out,

402
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,119
get out of the car now.

403
00:23:11,599 --> 00:23:13,839
Mr. Zhao, I've picked him up.

404
00:23:14,039 --> 00:23:16,559
We'll reach the surveillance zone in three minutes.

405
00:23:17,279 --> 00:23:18,599
Good. Hurry, hurry, hurry!

406
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:57,920
Here it is.

407
00:23:58,640 --> 00:23:59,279
Okay.

408
00:24:00,559 --> 00:24:01,720
Pull up the footage.

409
00:24:04,799 --> 00:24:05,920
Zoom in here.

410
00:24:08,519 --> 00:24:09,720
Old Xu, listen to me.

411
00:24:10,119 --> 00:24:11,240
Be very careful.

412
00:24:12,599 --> 00:24:13,359
Got it.

413
00:24:14,240 --> 00:24:14,880
We're here.

414
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,279
Little Yong.

415
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:27,559
Go, go, go.

416
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,240
Go on up.

417
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:56,200
Lao Kong.

418
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:57,759
We already went over this in the car.

419
00:24:59,160 --> 00:24:59,680
Hurry up and change.

420
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:01,079
Jacket, pants.

421
00:25:01,119 --> 00:25:02,960
Underwear, shoes, socks, change everything.

422
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:04,359
Don't get the left and right socks mixed up.

423
00:25:04,359 --> 00:25:05,079
Little Yong.

424
00:25:05,759 --> 00:25:07,440
Enough, it's too late to say anything now.

425
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:08,319
Little Yong, let's go.

426
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:09,440
Little Yong.

427
00:25:10,319 --> 00:25:11,119
Little Yong.

428
00:25:11,359 --> 00:25:12,160
Get in the car.

429
00:25:12,319 --> 00:25:13,119
Little Yong.

430
00:25:13,119 --> 00:25:13,880
Get in the car!

431
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,680
Let's change it.

432
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:31,920
No, the hair's wrong.

433
00:26:32,559 --> 00:26:33,160
Scissors.

434
00:26:35,279 --> 00:26:35,839
You cut it.

435
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:39,000
Hurry up.

436
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,079
Put this away.

437
00:27:05,519 --> 00:27:06,759
Follow my lead.

438
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,160
Put your hat on.

439
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,119
Give him the shovel.

440
00:27:24,759 --> 00:27:25,400
Go.

441
00:27:27,519 --> 00:27:28,240
Wait.

442
00:27:29,079 --> 00:27:30,400
Put the mask on after you pass the cameras.

443
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:00,200
Little Liu.

444
00:28:01,279 --> 00:28:02,079
Take Kevin to the car.

445
00:28:02,079 --> 00:28:02,799
Okay.

446
00:28:34,359 --> 00:28:36,000
Alright, let's take a break.

447
00:28:47,279 --> 00:28:48,119
Dig deeper.

448
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:03,079
Keep moving forward.

449
00:30:00,759 --> 00:30:01,720
What happened?

450
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,720
What's wrong? Speak!

451
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:10,880
Speak! What's wrong?

452
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:12,839
He's not dead.

453
00:30:13,799 --> 00:30:14,880
He's still alive.

454
00:30:17,400 --> 00:30:18,440
He's still alive.

455
00:30:18,599 --> 00:30:19,680
I really can't do this.

456
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:20,160
Old Xu.

457
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:20,799
No. No.

458
00:30:20,799 --> 00:30:21,519
I can't. I can't.

459
00:30:21,519 --> 00:30:22,240
Do you hear me?

460
00:30:22,799 --> 00:30:24,079
He's not dead yet. He's still moving.

461
00:30:24,279 --> 00:30:25,799
What are you doing here?

462
00:30:25,799 --> 00:30:27,559
Look. He's not dead yet. He's still alive.

463
00:30:27,599 --> 00:30:28,240
Look.

464
00:30:29,079 --> 00:30:29,839
Call an ambulance.

465
00:30:29,839 --> 00:30:31,119
Call an ambulance. Save him.

466
00:30:31,119 --> 00:30:31,960
There's still time.

467
00:30:32,119 --> 00:30:32,839
I promise.

468
00:30:32,839 --> 00:30:34,000
I won't tell anyone.

469
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:36,359
Call an ambulance. Call an ambulance.

470
00:30:36,359 --> 00:30:37,119
Save him.

471
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:39,839
Kill him. Kill him.

472
00:30:40,119 --> 00:30:41,160
This is murder.

473
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:42,759
This is murder, do you know that?

474
00:30:42,880 --> 00:30:44,759
Use the knife I just gave you.

475
00:30:44,759 --> 00:30:45,799
Stab him to death.

476
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:47,119
Then bury him.

477
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,960
No. I can't.

478
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,680
You said I was just taking the fall to serve time.

479
00:30:52,200 --> 00:30:53,599
You never said I had to actually kill someone.

480
00:30:53,759 --> 00:30:54,799
Old Xu, are you crazy?

481
00:30:54,799 --> 00:30:56,039
I really can't do it.

482
00:30:56,039 --> 00:30:56,720
Yijie.

483
00:30:56,720 --> 00:30:59,000
Finish this for him and you'll be free.

484
00:31:00,119 --> 00:31:00,960
This is murder.

485
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:02,519
This is murder, do you know that?

486
00:31:02,799 --> 00:31:04,720
This isn't just taking the fall anymore, Zhao Yijie.

487
00:31:04,720 --> 00:31:05,519
I'm too scared.

488
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:07,960
I can't do this.

489
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:09,799
He's just a kid.

490
00:31:10,559 --> 00:31:11,559
Do you see?

491
00:31:11,839 --> 00:31:13,920
He and Awu are both just kids.

492
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:17,079
Why would you make a kid do this?

493
00:31:17,559 --> 00:31:19,440
You always say you're Awu's father.

494
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:22,039
You're a father too.

495
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,799
Answer me!

496
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:28,559
Where are you?

497
00:31:29,039 --> 00:31:30,400
I'll do whatever you ask me to.

498
00:31:31,759 --> 00:31:32,799
But I won't kill anyone.

499
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,400
Forget it, Old Xu. Let him go.

500
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:47,960
Lu Zhiyong.

501
00:31:49,559 --> 00:31:50,960
Think about it carefully.

502
00:31:51,559 --> 00:31:53,960
A chance to change your life,

503
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:55,559
why would it so easily

504
00:31:55,559 --> 00:31:57,240
fall right into your lap?

505
00:31:58,160 --> 00:31:59,200
Turn around right now.

506
00:31:59,200 --> 00:32:00,400
Take a good look at this man.

507
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:02,720
Do you think he can survive?

508
00:32:07,079 --> 00:32:08,119
He won't make it.

509
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:10,400
Stab him.

510
00:32:11,079 --> 00:32:12,440
I said, let him go.

511
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,440
Little Lu.

512
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:24,519
You're only a teenager right now.

513
00:32:24,759 --> 00:32:25,920
After a few years inside,

514
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:27,799
you'll still be young when you come out.

515
00:32:28,200 --> 00:32:29,400
I can guarantee you that

516
00:32:30,279 --> 00:32:31,720
by the time you get out,

517
00:32:31,880 --> 00:32:34,000
you and your mom can live in

518
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:36,119
a nice house like the ones your dad built.

519
00:32:36,119 --> 00:32:37,599
You can even have a car.

520
00:32:41,079 --> 00:32:41,759
And,

521
00:32:42,599 --> 00:32:44,519
you and your mom will get a

522
00:32:44,799 --> 00:32:46,519
well-paying job.

523
00:32:46,759 --> 00:32:48,480
I promise you, I'm not lying.

524
00:32:48,839 --> 00:32:50,920
All you need to do right now is

525
00:32:53,799 --> 00:32:54,680
kill him.

526
00:32:56,559 --> 00:32:58,200
Put an end to this man's suffering.

527
00:32:58,640 --> 00:32:59,599
Let him go.

528
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:00,559
Kill him.

529
00:33:00,680 --> 00:33:02,359
Kill him now. Right now.

530
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:03,559
Xu Ruqing, do you know...

531
00:33:05,480 --> 00:33:06,039
Hello.

532
00:34:57,639 --> 00:34:58,280
Mr. Bi,

533
00:34:59,400 --> 00:34:59,960
follow me inside.

534
00:35:29,039 --> 00:35:31,440
I had no choice.

535
00:35:31,960 --> 00:35:33,559
I know why I had no choice.

536
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:35,039
Then why didn't you have a choice?

537
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,000
Or is there some force behind him

538
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,039
making you do this?

539
00:35:38,039 --> 00:35:40,239
That man was still breathing just now.

540
00:35:40,239 --> 00:35:41,159
He was still alive.

541
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:43,280
Why did you have to do this?

542
00:35:43,519 --> 00:35:44,639
Then go call the police.

543
00:35:45,119 --> 00:35:45,920
Go on.

544
00:35:46,400 --> 00:35:47,280
Go!

545
00:35:48,960 --> 00:35:50,679
Right, call the police.

546
00:35:53,559 --> 00:35:55,119
But if I call the police,

547
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,239
I'll be implicated.

548
00:35:58,880 --> 00:36:00,239
Who'll take care of Awu?

549
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:32,599
Awu, be gentle.

550
00:36:42,719 --> 00:36:44,800
Awu, are you hungry?

551
00:36:44,800 --> 00:36:45,880
Do you want something to eat?

552
00:36:49,159 --> 00:36:49,880
Awu!

553
00:36:52,480 --> 00:36:53,400
Awu!

554
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:58,840
Awu, why aren't you answering me?

555
00:37:03,880 --> 00:37:04,599
Awu!

556
00:37:06,280 --> 00:37:07,000
Awu!

557
00:37:07,559 --> 00:37:08,320
Awu!

558
00:37:17,599 --> 00:37:18,360
Awu!

559
00:37:24,079 --> 00:37:24,960
Awu!

560
00:37:34,119 --> 00:37:35,320
Awu, are you in there?

561
00:37:38,599 --> 00:37:39,800
Awu, come out!

562
00:37:42,599 --> 00:37:43,400
Awu!
